<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-ao">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
       <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
       
    <link rel="icon" href='https://imglur.com/get/r7vlDV.png'>
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/header.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/sobre.css">
    <title>Projectent Animes - Sobre</title>
        <style type="text/css">
*{
    border: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body{
    font-family: Arial,"Time New Roman",sans-serif;
    background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22);
    color: #e8e9e7;
}

.header {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100px;
  background-color: rgba(29, 29, 29, 0.945);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 9;
}

.header .logo {
  width: 20%;
  height: 75%;
  display: flex;
  margin-left: 20px;
}

.header .logo a {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: flex;
}

.header .logo a img {
  width: 100%;
}

.header .navbar {
  margin-right: 35px;
  display: flex;
}

.header .navbar ul {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
}

.header .navbar ul li {
  padding: 10px;
}

.header .navbar ul li a {
  text-decoration: none;
  text-transform: capitalize;
  padding: 10px 6px;
  color: #e8e9e7;
  font-size: clamp(10px,1.5vw,20px);
  transition: background-color .50s ease-in-out;


}

.header .navbar ul li a:hover {
  background-color: #4ae2e7;
  color: #000;
}

#mobile {
  display: none;
}

#mobile li:hover {
  background-color: #3d3d3d;
}

.menubar {
  background-color: rgba(29, 29, 29, 0.767);
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
  display: none;
}

.showmenu {
  display: block;
}

.menubar ul {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 90%;
  height: 100vh;
  list-style: none;
  padding: 12px 0px;
  background-color: #141414;

}

.menubar ul li {
  background-color: #141414;
  padding: 10px 8px;
}

.menubar ul li a {
  color: #e8e9e7;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 3.4vw;
  padding: 12px 6px;
  display: block;
  transition: all 1s ease;
}

.menubar ul li a:hover {
  background-color: #4ae2e7;
  color: #000;
}

.menubar i {
  font-size: 5vw;
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  left: 5px;
  z-index: 9;
}

.menubar ul li form input[type="search"] {
  background-color: transparent;
  border: 1px solid #e8e9e7;
  border-radius: 4px;
  color: #e8e9e7;
  width: 65%;
}

.menubar ul li form input[type="submit"] {
  background-color: #0b6100;
  color: #e8e9e7;
  margin-left: 5px;
  width: 30%;
  font-size: 3.4vw
}

.menubar ul li form input {
  padding: 8px;
}

.main{
    width: 95%;
    margin: 40px auto;
    height: 45vh;
}

.main .container{
    width: 100%;
}

.main .container h2{
    position: relative;
    background-color: #0b6100;
    line-height: 8vh;
    padding-left: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 4vw;
}

.main .container p{
    width: 90%;
    margin: auto;
    font-size:clamp(12px,3.5vw,40px);
    text-align:justify;
}

.close-style{
    font-size: 24px;
    z-index: 3;
}

hr{
    border: 1px solid #fff;
    width: 95%;
    margin: auto;
}

.footer {
  text-align: center;
  width:80%;
  margin:auto;
}

.footer h1 {
  line-height: 80px;
  font-size: clamp(12px,5vw,48px);

}

.footer p {
  line-height: clamp(12px,5vw,48px);
  text-align:justify;
  font-size: clamp(12px,3.5vw,40px);
  margin-bottom:12px;

}


@media (max-width:989px) {
    .main .content .box-cards{
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px;

}

.main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 250px;
    min-width: 90px;

}
    
}

@media (max-width:765px){
    .main .content .box-cards{
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 200px;
  
}
}

@media (max-width:524px){
    #mobile{display: flex;}
    #desktop-bar{display: none;}
    .main .content .box-cards{
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 150px;
  
}
}

@media (max-width:488px){
    #desktop-bar{display: none;}
    .main .content .box-cards{
    gap: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 150px;
  
}
}

@media (max-width:472px){
    #desktop-bar{display: none;}
    .main .content .box-cards{
    grid-template-columns: auto auto auto auto;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 150px;
  
}
}

@media (max-width:472px){
    #desktop-bar{display: none;}
    .main .content .box-cards{
    grid-template-columns: auto auto auto;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 150px;
  
}
}

@media (max-width:297px){
    #desktop-bar{display: none;}
    .main .content .box-cards{
    grid-template-columns: auto auto;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;

}
    .main .content .box-cards .cards{
    height: 150px;
  
}
}
    </style>
        
        <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/c9a2912041.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

        <script src="https://pl29332336.profitablecpmratenetwork.com/32/ac/87/32ac87b22a31578e408a336d707868c2.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
 <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">
            <a href="/">
                <img src='https://imglur.com/get/XN4hTb.png' alt='XN4hTb'>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="navbar">
            <ul id="mobile">
                <li id="ico-menu"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i></li>            

            </ul>
            <ul id="desktop-bar">
                <li><a href="/">Pagina inicial</a></li>
                <li><a href="/lancamentos">Lançamentos</a></li>
                <li><a href="/generos">Gêneros</a></li>
                <li><a href="/search">Pesquisar</a></li>
                <li><a href="/sobre">Sobre</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="menubar">
            <span class="close-style">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-close"></i>
            </span>
             <ul>
                <li><form action="/search"><input type="search" name="title"><input type="submit" value="Pesquisar"></form></li>
                <li><a href="/">Pagina inicial</a></li>
                <li><a href="/lancamentos">Lançamentos</a></li>
                <li><a href="/generos">Gêneros</a></li>
                <li><a href="/sobre">Sobre</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    

    <div class="main">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Sobre</h2>
            <p>Este site tem como objectivo disponibilizar todo o conteúdo possível da cultura popular, para que todos possam ter facilidade de acessar de graça. Qualquer coisa ou incomodo disponibizamos as noaaas redes sociais </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="footer">
        <h1>Projectent</h1>
        <p>Este site não utiliza o proprio servidor para hospedar os videos.Para melhor experiência no Android recomendamos usar o navegador UC BROWSER ou algo equivalente.</p>
        <p>Siga as nossas páginas do Facebook para mais informações.</p>
        <p>Nossos outros projectos <a href="/doramas">Doramas</a></p>
    </div>

    <script>
const menu = document.querySelector('#ico-menu')
const menuBar = document.querySelector('.menubar')
const faclose = document.querySelector('.close-style')


menu.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    menuBar.classList.toggle('showmenu')

})

faclose.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    menuBar.classList.toggle('showmenu')

})
    </script>

</body>
</html>
